[metadata] {"type": "create", "filePath": "/workspace/repo/.changeset/switch-case-trailing-comment-idempotence.md", "content": "---
"@biomejs/biome": patch
---

Fixed a formatter idempotence bug where trailing line comments on `case` clauses were moved into a hugging block statement on a second format pass.

```diff
  switch (key) {
    case a: // comment a
    case b: { // comment b
-     // comment b
      doStuff();
      break;
    }
  }
```

Biome now keeps such comments on the same line as their `case` keyword, so formatting the already-formatted output produces the same result.
